00:00:05.117 --> 00:00:06.347
Which tools are allowed?

00:00:06.897 --> 00:00:08.207
When does access end?

00:00:08.517 --> 00:00:09.747
Who can revoke it?

00:00:10.617 --> 00:00:12.307
Meet MCP Runtime.

00:00:12.477 --> 00:00:15.067
Your control plane for MCP servers.

00:00:16.150 --> 00:00:17.380
Deploy your servers.

