Publish tools for your team.

00:00:20.517 --> 00:00:24.187
Give agents specific tools
and time-limited access.

00:00:24.597 --> 00:00:26.847
The gateway checks each governed call.

00:00:27.750 --> 00:00:32.240
See what was allowed or denied,
and investigate the recorded decisions.

00:00:34.170 --> 00:00:34.550
Your infrastructure.

00:00:34.730 --> 00:00:35.680
Your rules.

00:00:35.830 --> 00:00:36.900
One platform.

